Flexbox XML fixtures ported from Taffy.

Source
  tests/xml/flex/ in https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy
  at commit b3b387132be1dda0e9d08d5044692236532c166d
  (pinned in upstream.pins).

  These are MIT-licensed files from Taffy, carried under the Taffy entry
  in NOTICE.

Coverage
  2508 of 2656 upstream fixtures are included. The 148 excluded are:

    136  balance_*                        feature-gated upstream, not in this port
      4  bevy_issue_10343_grid__*         grid
      4  bevy_issue_21240__*              grid, despite living in tests/xml/flex/
      4  overflow_start_edge_absolute_child__*
                                          absolute positioning inside a block
                                          container, beyond the flexbox port

  The exclusion list is enforced by TestFlexFixtureDrift in flex_test.go,
  which compares this directory against the upstream checkout and fails on
  anything unaccounted for in either direction. The test skips when
  _upstream/taffy is not present.
